  "draft": "flowchart ropAlgorithms \"Алгоритмы РОП\"\nalgorithm D07_algorithm_price.algorithm \"Алгоритм расчёта цены и массы\"\ndiagram D07_algorithm_price \"Алгоритм расчёта цены и массы\" algorithm=D07_algorithm_price.algorithm type=algorithm\nstart D07_algorithm_price.a Начало owner=D07_algorithm_price.algorithm\nview D07_algorithm_price.a_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.a\ninput D07_algorithm_price.b \"Модельный ряд, выбранные предложения\\nи версия правил\" owner=D07_algorithm_price.algorithm\nview D07_algorithm_price.b_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.b\ndecision D07_algorithm_price.c \"Все слоты разрешены,\\nцены свежие и масса > 0?\" expression=\"Все слоты разрешены, цены свежие и масса > 0?\" mode=binary owner=D07_algorithm_price.algorithm\nview D07_algorithm_price.c_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.c\noutput D07_algorithm_price.err \"Выдать причины\\nрасчёт не сохранять\" owner=D07_algorithm_price.algorithm\nview D07_algorithm_price.err_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.err\noperation D07_algorithm_price.d \"C = Σ qᵢpᵢ + A + U\\nW = wкорпуса + Σ qᵢwᵢ + wуп\" owner=D07_algorithm_price.algorithm\nview D07_algorithm_price.d_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.d\noperation D07_algorithm_price.e \"P = ceil(C(1 + m)/s) × s\\nокруглить массу до 0,001 кг\" owner=D07_algorithm_price.algorithm\nview D07_algorithm_price.e_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.e\noutput D07_algorithm_price.f \"Сохранить расчёт и снимок\\nцен, состава и правил\" owner=D07_algorithm_price.algorithm\nview D07_algorithm_price.f_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.f\nflow D07_algorithm_price.flow1 \"\" from=D07_algorithm_price.a to=D07_algorithm_price.b\nview D07_algorithm_price.flow1_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.flow1 from=D07_algorithm_price.a_view to=D07_algorithm_price.b_view\nflow D07_algorithm_price.flow2 \"\" from=D07_algorithm_price.b to=D07_algorithm_price.c\nview D07_algorithm_price.flow2_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.flow2 from=D07_algorithm_price.b_view to=D07_algorithm_price.c_view\nflow D07_algorithm_price.flow3 Нет from=D07_algorithm_price.c otherwise=true to=D07_algorithm_price.err\nview D07_algorithm_price.flow3_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.flow3 from=D07_algorithm_price.c_view to=D07_algorithm_price.err_view\nflow D07_algorithm_price.flow4 Да from=D07_algorithm_price.c guard=\"Все слоты разрешены, цены свежие и масса > 0\" to=D07_algorithm_price.d\nview D07_algorithm_price.flow4_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.flow4 from=D07_algorithm_price.c_view to=D07_algorithm_price.d_view\nflow D07_algorithm_price.flow5 \"\" from=D07_algorithm_price.d to=D07_algorithm_price.e\nview D07_algorithm_price.flow5_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.flow5 from=D07_algorithm_price.d_view to=D07_algorithm_price.e_view\nflow D07_algorithm_price.flow6 \"\" from=D07_algorithm_price.e to=D07_algorithm_price.f\nview D07_algorithm_price.flow6_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.flow6 from=D07_algorithm_price.e_view to=D07_algorithm_price.f_view\nend D07_algorithm_price.err_end Конец owner=D07_algorithm_price.algorithm\nview D07_algorithm_price.err_end_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.err_end\nflow D07_algorithm_price.err_endFlow \"\" from=D07_algorithm_price.err to=D07_algorithm_price.err_end\nview D07_algorithm_price.err_endFlow_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.err_endFlow from=D07_algorithm_price.err_view to=D07_algorithm_price.err_end_view\nend D07_algorithm_price.f_end Конец owner=D07_algorithm_price.algorithm\nview D07_algorithm_price.f_end_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.f_end\nflow D07_algorithm_price.f_endFlow \"\" from=D07_algorithm_price.f to=D07_algorithm_price.f_end\nview D07_algorithm_price.f_endFlow_view \"\" diagram=D07_algorithm_price element=D07_algorithm_price.f_endFlow from=D07_algorithm_price.f_view to=D07_algorithm_price.f_end_view\nalgorithm D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm \"Алгоритм выбора предложения для слота\"\ndiagram D08_algorithm_offer \"Алгоритм выбора предложения для слота\" algorithm=D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm type=algorithm\nstart D08_algorithm_offer.a Начало owner=D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm\nview D08_algorithm_offer.a_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.a\ninput D08_algorithm_offer.b \"Компонент или группа\\nколичество и закреплённый SKU\" owner=D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm\nview D08_algorithm_offer.b_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.b\noperation D08_algorithm_offer.c \"Отфильтровать по совместимости,\\nналичию и сроку актуальности\" owner=D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm\nview D08_algorithm_offer.c_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.c\ndecision D08_algorithm_offer.d \"Есть допустимые\\nпредложения?\" expression=\"Есть допустимые предложения?\" mode=binary owner=D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm\nview D08_algorithm_offer.d_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.d\noutput D08_algorithm_offer.err \"Зафиксировать причину\\nпотребовать ручное решение\" owner=D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm\nview D08_algorithm_offer.err_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.err\noperation D08_algorithm_offer.e \"Сортировать: приоритет поставщика,\\nцена, время, идентификатор\" owner=D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm\nview D08_algorithm_offer.e_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.e\noutput D08_algorithm_offer.f \"Сохранить offer_id\\nи разрешённый компонент\" owner=D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm\nview D08_algorithm_offer.f_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.f\nflow D08_algorithm_offer.flow1 \"\" from=D08_algorithm_offer.a to=D08_algorithm_offer.b\nview D08_algorithm_offer.flow1_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.flow1 from=D08_algorithm_offer.a_view to=D08_algorithm_offer.b_view\nflow D08_algorithm_offer.flow2 \"\" from=D08_algorithm_offer.b to=D08_algorithm_offer.c\nview D08_algorithm_offer.flow2_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.flow2 from=D08_algorithm_offer.b_view to=D08_algorithm_offer.c_view\nflow D08_algorithm_offer.flow3 \"\" from=D08_algorithm_offer.c to=D08_algorithm_offer.d\nview D08_algorithm_offer.flow3_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.flow3 from=D08_algorithm_offer.c_view to=D08_algorithm_offer.d_view\nflow D08_algorithm_offer.flow4 Нет from=D08_algorithm_offer.d otherwise=true to=D08_algorithm_offer.err\nview D08_algorithm_offer.flow4_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.flow4 from=D08_algorithm_offer.d_view to=D08_algorithm_offer.err_view\nflow D08_algorithm_offer.flow5 Да from=D08_algorithm_offer.d guard=\"Есть допустимые предложения\" to=D08_algorithm_offer.e\nview D08_algorithm_offer.flow5_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.flow5 from=D08_algorithm_offer.d_view to=D08_algorithm_offer.e_view\nflow D08_algorithm_offer.flow6 \"\" from=D08_algorithm_offer.e to=D08_algorithm_offer.f\nview D08_algorithm_offer.flow6_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.flow6 from=D08_algorithm_offer.e_view to=D08_algorithm_offer.f_view\nend D08_algorithm_offer.err_end Конец owner=D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm\nview D08_algorithm_offer.err_end_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.err_end\nflow D08_algorithm_offer.err_endFlow \"\" from=D08_algorithm_offer.err to=D08_algorithm_offer.err_end\nview D08_algorithm_offer.err_endFlow_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.err_endFlow from=D08_algorithm_offer.err_view to=D08_algorithm_offer.err_end_view\nend D08_algorithm_offer.f_end Конец owner=D08_algorithm_offer.algorithm\nview D08_algorithm_offer.f_end_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.f_end\nflow D08_algorithm_offer.f_endFlow \"\" from=D08_algorithm_offer.f to=D08_algorithm_offer.f_end\nview D08_algorithm_offer.f_endFlow_view \"\" diagram=D08_algorithm_offer element=D08_algorithm_offer.f_endFlow from=D08_algorithm_offer.f_view to=D08_algorithm_offer.f_end_view\nalgorithm D09_algorithm_replace.algorithm \"Алгоритм массовой замены\"\ndiagram D09_algorithm_replace \"Алгоритм массовой замены\" algorithm=D09_algorithm_replace.algorithm type=algorithm\ninput D09_algorithm_replace.a \"Предпросмотр и подтверждение\\nсписка модельных рядов и версий\" owner=D09_algorithm_replace.algorithm\nview D09_algorithm_replace.a_view \"\" diagram=D09_algorithm_replace element=D09_algorithm_replace.a\ndecision D09_algorithm_replace.b \"Есть следующий модельный ряд?\" expression=\"Есть следующий модельный ряд?\" mode=binary owner=D09_algorithm_replace.algorithm\nview D09_algorithm_replace.b_view \"\" diagram=D09_algorithm_replace element=D09_algorithm_replace.b\noutput D09_algorithm_replace.end \"Завершить пакет\\nпоказать APPLIED / CONFLICT\" owner=D09_algorithm_replace.algorithm\nview D09_algorithm_replace.end_view \"\" diagram=D09_algorithm_replace element=D09_algorithm_replace.end\ndecision D09_algorithm_replace.c \"Версия не изменилась?\" expression=\"Версия не изменилась?\" mode=binary owner=D09_algorithm_replace.algorithm\nview D09_algorithm_replace.c_view \"\" diagram=D09_algorithm_replace element=D09_algorithm_replace.c\noperation D09_algorithm_replace.skip \"Сохранить CONFLICT\\nисходный модельный ряд не менять\" owner=D09_algorithm_replace.algorithm\nview D09_algorithm_replace.skip_view \"\" diagram=D09_algorithm_replace element=D09_algorithm_replace.skip\noperation D09_a